SUMMARY
Cost accountant and CPA with four years in food manufacturing and pharmaceutical distribution. I own inventory valuation under ASC 330, standard costing in NetSuite, and the cycle count and physical inventory programs that keep the book-to-floor variance small. Available in about a month.

EXPERIENCE
Peachtree Pharma Distribution, Cost Accountant, Atlanta, GA, Jul 2024 - Present
- Value $38M of pharmaceutical inventory across 2 distribution centers under ASC 330: lower of cost and net realizable value review monthly, excess and short-dated reserve of about $1.2M, and lot-level costing in NetSuite.
- Run the cycle count program: 1,400 SKUs counted on an ABC schedule (A items monthly, B quarterly, C twice a year), with a book-to-floor accuracy above 99.5% for the last five quarters.
- Coordinate the annual physical inventory with the warehouse manager and the auditors, including count sheet controls, cutoff testing and the reconciliation of count-to-book adjustments, which came in at 0.08% of inventory value last year.
- Prepare the monthly gross margin and inventory rollforward analysis in Excel and investigate purchase price and freight variances over $5,000.
- Maintain landed cost setup in NetSuite for imported products, allocating freight, duty and cold-chain handling.

Magnolia Bakehouse Foods, Cost Accountant, Atlanta, GA, Oct 2022 - Jun 2024
- Set annual standard costs for 220 baked goods SKUs in NetSuite (ingredients, labor, overhead) and analyzed monthly material usage and yield variances for a $55M plant.
- Valued raw ingredients, packaging and finished goods under ASC 330 with FIFO and a spoilage reserve; wrote the reserve methodology the auditors accepted without adjustment.
- Led weekly cycle counts of ingredients and packaging and the semi-annual full physical inventory across the plant and two freezers, reducing unexplained shrink from 1.9% to 0.7%.
- Built the Excel bill-of-materials cost rollup used for pricing and customer bids.

EDUCATION
B.B.A. Accounting, State University

CERTIFICATIONS
Certified Public Accountant (Georgia)

